Self-contained page (HTML + d3 v7 vendored + CSV data) with four tabs:
"O que melhorou", "O que piorou", "Professores", "Pensionistas", a period
selector (2018–2022 / 2022–2026 / full series) and a source popover: every
number is traceable to a CSV row in brasil/data/ and every variation to
the formula that computed it. No build step; Jekyll copies the folder as-is.

Sources: IBGE, INPE, Inep, Ministério da Saúde, FBSP, Banco Central, Serasa,
MapBiomas, OCDE/PISA, Ministério da Previdência/INSS, PF/CGU. Derived or
approximate points are flagged in an "estimado" column.
